---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Classic BMW & Porsche Repair, Specs, and Buyer's Guides
description: "Known problems, real repair costs, torque specs, parts sources, and buyer's guides for classic BMWs and Porsches, from the E28 and 924 to the E90 and 991."
extraScripts:
  - js/newsletter.js
---

<!-- Hero -->
<section class="home-hero">
    <div class="home-hero-media">
        {% picture "/images/hero-bg.jpg", "", "100vw", { loading: "eager", fetchpriority: "high" } %}
    </div>
    <div class="home-hero-content">
        <h1>Old BMWs and Porsches, <span class="highlight">kept on the road.</span></h1>
        <p class="hero-subtitle">What breaks, what it costs to fix, the torque spec, and where to buy the part. {{ stats.vehicles }} cars from the E28 to the 991, written for anyone with a floor jack and a free Saturday.</p>
        <form class="hero-search" action="/search/" method="get" role="search">
            <label for="hero-search-input" class="visually-hidden">Search issues, guides, specs, and parts</label>
            <input type="search" id="hero-search-input" name="q" placeholder="VANOS, IMS bearing, rear subframe…" autocomplete="off">
            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Search</button>
        </form>
        <p class="hero-popular">
            <span>People look up:</span>
            <a href="/search/?q=vanos">VANOS</a>
            <a href="/search/?q=ims+bearing">IMS bearing</a>
            <a href="/search/?q=cooling">Cooling system</a>
            <a href="/search/?q=subframe">Subframe</a>
            <a href="/search/?q=timing+belt">Timing belt</a>
        </p>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- Stats -->
<section class="stats-bar" aria-label="What's on the site">
    <dl class="stats-container">
        <div class="stat-item"><dt class="stat-label">Cars covered</dt><dd class="stat-number">{{ stats.vehicles }}</dd></div>
        <div class="stat-item"><dt class="stat-label">Known issues</dt><dd class="stat-number">{{ stats.issues }}</dd></div>
        <div class="stat-item"><dt class="stat-label">Guides</dt><dd class="stat-number">{{ stats.guides }}</dd></div>
        <div class="stat-item"><dt class="stat-label">Torque specs</dt><dd class="stat-number">{{ stats.torqueSpecs }}</dd></div>
    </dl>
</section>

<!-- Cars -->
<section id="vehicles" class="vehicles-section">
    <div class="section-header">
        <h2>Pick your car</h2>
        <p>Every page has the known problems, repair costs, guides, torque specs, parts sources, and a buyer's guide.</p>
    </div>

    {% asyncEach brand in [["bmw", "BMW"], ["porsche", "Porsche"]] %}
    <div class="brand-block">
        <div class="brand-header">
            <h3 class="brand-title">{{ brand[1] }}</h3>
            <a href="/resources/{{ brand[0] }}/" class="brand-link">All {{ brand[1] }} →</a>
        </div>
        {% set brandKey = brand[0] %}
        {% include "partials/vehicle-grid.njk" %}
    </div>
    {% endeach %}
</section>

<!-- What's on a car page -->
<section class="features-section">
    <div class="section-header">
        <h2>What's on every car page</h2>
        <p>Written for people who do their own work, or want to know what the shop is talking about.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="features-grid">
        <div class="feature-card">
            <span class="feature-icon">{% include "icons/alert.svg" %}</span>
            <h3>Known problems and what they cost</h3>
            <p>Symptoms, causes, and fixes for the failures each car is known for, with DIY and shop price ranges so you can budget before anything lets go.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
            <span class="feature-icon">{% include "icons/wrench.svg" %}</span>
            <h3>Step-by-step guides</h3>
            <p>Parts lists with part numbers, the tools you'll need, the order to do it in, and the warnings that save you a second trip to the parts store.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
            <span class="feature-icon">{% include "icons/gauge.svg" %}</span>
            <h3>Torque specs, with sources</h3>
            <p>Engine, suspension, brakes, and drivetrain values in one table, with the references they came from listed underneath.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
            <span class="feature-icon">{% include "icons/book.svg" %}</span>
            <h3>Buyer's guides</h3>
            <p>Which version to buy, a printable pre-purchase checklist, red flags, and what a fair price looks like right now.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- Tools & Garage -->
<section class="tools-section">
    <div class="tools-container">
        <div class="tools-content">
            <h2>Your car, tracked</h2>
            <p>Add your car to My Garage and you get a service schedule for that platform with intervals already filled in, a restoration tracker, and a log of every job. Free, and it syncs between your phone and your laptop.</p>
            <div class="tools-list">
                <a href="/account/garage/" class="tool-item">
                    <span class="tool-icon">{% include "icons/car.svg" %}</span>
                    <span class="tool-info">
                        <h3>My Garage</h3>
                        <p>Maintenance tracker and restoration tracker for each car you own.</p>
                    </span>
                    <span class="tool-arrow" aria-hidden="true">{% include "icons/arrow-right.svg" %}</span>
                </a>
                <a href="/tools/build-calculator/" class="tool-item">
                    <span class="tool-icon">{% include "icons/calculator.svg" %}</span>
                    <span class="tool-info">
                        <h3>Build Cost Calculator</h3>
                        <p>Price out a restoration before you commit. No account needed.</p>
                    </span>
                    <span class="tool-arrow" aria-hidden="true">{% include "icons/arrow-right.svg" %}</span>
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- Forum -->
<section class="community-section">
    <div class="community-container">
        <div class="community-content">
            <h2>Ask the forum</h2>
            <p>A board for each car. Post the weird noise, the part you can't identify, or the build you're halfway through.</p>
            <a href="/forum/" class="btn btn-primary">Go to the forum</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- Newsletter -->
<section class="newsletter-section" id="newsletter">
    <div class="newsletter-container">
        <div class="newsletter-content">
            <h2>New guides by email</h2>
            <p>When a new car or a new guide goes up, I'll send a short note. That's it.</p>
            <form class="newsletter-form" data-newsletter-form>
                <div class="newsletter-input-group">
                    <label for="newsletter-email" class="visually-hidden">Email address</label>
                    <input type="email" id="newsletter-email" placeholder="you@example.com" required class="newsletter-input" autocomplete="email">
                    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary newsletter-btn">Sign me up</button>
                </div>
                <p class="newsletter-status" data-newsletter-status role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
                <p class="newsletter-note">Unsubscribe from any email. Want a garage too? <a href="/account/register/">Create a free account</a>.</p>
            </form>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
